    "intro_html":  "Million Dollar spaghetti stacks a beef and hot Italian sausage marinara over noodles with a secret middle layer of ricotta, cream cheese, and sour cream, then buries it in mozzarella. Rich name, poverty price: \u003cstrong\u003e35 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e per serving for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.01\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The name oversells the cost by roughly a million dollars.",
